      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `1088a2bf48fc2a19b07a43d50a3bd8b330cab69505dac54a050c08b7f445acfc--Adult_Custody_Report_-_June_2026.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: BOCSAR — Custody (NSW Bureau of Crime Statistics and Research)\n- Release or year: 2026-06\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 16 of 16\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Cover\" | 5b4ed6426624d0ca8233eb89d6014f48f82057a20e37b1df8fcbccbb6217e582 | missing |\n| \"Table of contents\" | 97d52fbd2a582ca798f7abfdb50e3bceeaa2e17f5b5a3f0476257df06f8c53eb | missing |\n| \"1. Summary\" | 276ad1331ab9579253f69251e66a77332cb2c1cab3c423d60d0280a691ae24ec | missing |\n| \"2. Aboriginal Summary\" | f156ef454662f1d90a77287413030314bddbf2d7c52a371082b4823835cae50c | missing |\n| \"3. Custody population\" | 112aecfc979dc82dc2534dd60d0e89f3b4f270ec6c7b0d72eeea639a46961f99 | missing |\n| \"4. Population by offence\" | 9d9a6ef2d88d13afd215f2d3b7b003ee3843243df65e1ddd7a859196c35341dc | missing |\n| \"5. Population by SA4\" | 371ae3e10015de30c555ec75f53c925571d2956c036418c1b50bff03385ba78d | missing |\n| \"6. Custody receptions\" | fe6e2af3c0cf2ae3633e7a6dea98853a41d20647fc04fce5340abd44eddac59e | missing |\n| \"7. Custody discharges\" | cded3d3f4b2ae4ed43a88f9d93bce4a50b964a256b3ab87790342183c81d05b5 | missing |\n| \"8. Remand to Sentenced\" | 2f6eeb75aa5761171d0dfa29e26c35fed0ca94570c177bc6382a5eada77ca332 | missing |\n| \"9. Time on remand\" | f6b2e7414be31bb6a9a4267542df35799cff49a70fc630e93ecd0f56e0719d58 | missing |\n| \"10. Aboriginal time on remand\" | 96e712c9541f9c46de702c189024fa2ac787dd7a7a7a8cdb71abff3b974499d7 | missing |\n| \"stock_data\" | 3b193bef290234273e19476f109aaf7d76ca37dfe6edc6c201b8257615ae30fb | missing |\n| \"reception_data\" | c1a9b1235bb09f5cace6354db875f8b574061cf3c17adc9e77176558d86e4a90 | missing |\n| \"discharge_data\" | 15605730a1520543bb38c6e77bd8a4a7a4f92c8fd45d3f12d1d10d1606cb915c | missing |\n| \"remand_to_sentenced_data\" | 9c